<title>USA: TriNet buys Baltimore property for $9.7 mln.</title>
<headline>TriNet buys Baltimore property for $9.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>TriNet Corporate Realty Trust said Wednesday that it acquired a 222,636 square foot regional distribution center in the Baltimore area for $9.7 million.</p>
<p>The acquisition is TriNet's first in the Baltimore area, an area the company said it is targeting for industrial investment.</p>
<p>TriNet said the property is leased to Sunbelt Beverage Corp, a wine and liquor distributor.</p>
<p>TriNet is a real estate investment trust (REIT) which acquires, owns and manages office and industrial properties leased to major corporations.</p>
